# Fork in the Road (WotG 50) in Jugner Forest [S], the Ronfaure Dawndrop and the six other dawndrops held: blank_fork
# plays 7 [82, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7340037]; its finish gives the zone's dawndrop (1724, message 6398), says
# GATHERED_DAWNDROPS_LIGHT (8650, the Primal Glow) and RETRACED_ALL_JUNCTIONS (messageName 8651), takes the seven
# dawndrops (one key item list each, in the pairs order Beaucedine, Jugner, San d'Oria, Walk of Echoes, La Vaule,
# Xarcabard, Throne Room) and the Ronfaure Dawndrop, and completes the mission (the Primal Glow, 1731, message 6398;
# Maiden of the Dusk current).
lists JugnerForestS/blank_fork/onTrigger JugnerForestS/onEventFinish/7
char zone=JugnerForestS pos=47.833,0.109,309.025 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ForkInTheRoad current
keyitem RonfaureDawndrop
keyitem LaVauleDawndrop
keyitem SanDoriaDawndrop
keyitem BeaucedineDawndrop
keyitem XarcabardDawndrop
keyitem ThroneRoomDawndrop
keyitem WalkOfEchoesDawndrop
login
trigger blank_fork                         # 7
finish                                     # the seventh dawndrop: the messages, all taken, completed
